        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WBHOOK, Wire Basket Hook Add-On</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a solid brass hook add-on for Deltana's Bathroom Wire Baskets. Since it is made out of solid brass, it will resists tarnishing. The Wire Basket Hook is perfectly designed to hold your toothbrush and razor, but it can hold a lot of other things too, since it is a hook. Hang your loofa on it or even your wash cloth to dry. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBHOOK-speicifiations.gif?v=1704354656\" width=\"599\" height=\"170\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DEL-WBHOOK Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSee our full selection of <a href=\"/collections/bathroom-hardware-1\">Deltana Wire Baskets</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Bathroom Wire Basket Hook Add On:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 1.725\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1.775\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 1.83\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBHOOK-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262325\" target=\"new\"><b>DEL-WBHOOK Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
